{"3980890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kill Code", "steam_appid": 3980890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT THE LAST HUMANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity lost the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few survivors remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Incursor, sent to finish the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER HIGH-SPEED COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through bullet storms, deflect deadly attacks, and chain devastating melee and ranged abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/94271ae3993712889216bdd11f03c9b4.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/94271ae3993712889216bdd11f03c9b4.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/94271ae3993712889216bdd11f03c9b4.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPROGRAM ORB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your floating companion into specialized weapons and build new ways to annihilate your targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every loadout changes how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/d58aecd7f4b4850f92fc156340b61bcb.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/d58aecd7f4b4850f92fc156340b61bcb.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/d58aecd7f4b4850f92fc156340b61bcb.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH DEVASTATING ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch enemies into the air, crash into the battlefield, and carve through entire squads with powerful combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the perfect machine hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/84b36bc9bb11e727107c60a40e30d75e.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/84b36bc9bb11e727107c60a40e30d75e.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/84b36bc9bb11e727107c60a40e30d75e.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR INCURSOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect relics, discover powerful synergies, and visually transform your Incursor as your build evolves throughout each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/58c294ed1d9153c27ac83da8830da43a.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/58c294ed1d9153c27ac83da8830da43a.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/58c294ed1d9153c27ac83da8830da43a.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVE BEYOND YOUR LIMITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills, combat mechanics, and passive upgrades through an extensive progression tree filled with meaningful choices and branching paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade brings you closer to becoming the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/394d40b7b86ed9e2d182ae493b0ced19.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/394d40b7b86ed9e2d182ae493b0ced19.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/394d40b7b86ed9e2d182ae493b0ced19.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FUTURE BELONGS TO THE MACHINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure no human survives.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT THE LAST HUMANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity lost the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a few survivors remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Incursor, sent to finish the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER HIGH-SPEED COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through bullet storms, deflect deadly attacks, and chain devastating melee and ranged abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/94271ae3993712889216bdd11f03c9b4.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/94271ae3993712889216bdd11f03c9b4.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/94271ae3993712889216bdd11f03c9b4.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPROGRAM ORB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your floating companion into specialized weapons and build new ways to annihilate your targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every loadout changes how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/d58aecd7f4b4850f92fc156340b61bcb.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/d58aecd7f4b4850f92fc156340b61bcb.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/d58aecd7f4b4850f92fc156340b61bcb.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH DEVASTATING ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch enemies into the air, crash into the battlefield, and carve through entire squads with powerful combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the perfect machine hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/84b36bc9bb11e727107c60a40e30d75e.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/84b36bc9bb11e727107c60a40e30d75e.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/84b36bc9bb11e727107c60a40e30d75e.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR INCURSOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect relics, discover powerful synergies, and visually transform your Incursor as your build evolves throughout each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/58c294ed1d9153c27ac83da8830da43a.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/58c294ed1d9153c27ac83da8830da43a.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/58c294ed1d9153c27ac83da8830da43a.mp4?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVE BEYOND YOUR LIMITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills, combat mechanics, and passive upgrades through an extensive progression tree filled with meaningful choices and branching paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade brings you closer to becoming the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/394d40b7b86ed9e2d182ae493b0ced19.poster.avif?t=1781500195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/394d40b7b86ed9e2d182ae493b0ced19.webm?t=1781500195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980890/extras/394d40b7b86ed9e2d182ae